{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03424",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 8.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "So, hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.91,
      "end_seconds": 13.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 15.74,
      "end_seconds": 24.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed. Doctor, it's chest pain. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.28,
      "end_seconds": 28.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.36,
      "end_seconds": 32.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I've had it for about a month"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.29,
      "end_seconds": 42.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.86,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.28,
      "end_seconds": 59.23,
      "duration_seconds": 15.95,
      "text": "Right, I'd say every other day. Maybe a seven out of ten on a a bad day. I get some relief from sitting forward. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.96,
      "end_seconds": 62.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.71,
      "end_seconds": 73.51,
      "duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get a racing heart as well the racing heart? That's been since Friday"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.38,
      "end_seconds": 76.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "have you had shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.41,
      "end_seconds": 85.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, about the same, one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.84,
      "end_seconds": 92.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.19,
      "end_seconds": 95.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "it happens on and off"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.88,
      "end_seconds": 96.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.66,
      "end_seconds": 102.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "I've been feeling faint too, since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.92,
      "end_seconds": 109.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any cough or leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.55,
      "end_seconds": 113.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "no, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.91,
      "end_seconds": 117.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "So, how about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.76,
      "end_seconds": 122.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 123.88,
      "end_seconds": 129.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.35,
      "end_seconds": 137.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "No, uh, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.7,
      "end_seconds": 144.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.03,
      "end_seconds": 148.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "hm, okay anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.02,
      "end_seconds": 152.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "that's normal as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.44,
      "end_seconds": 157.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Right, do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.76,
      "end_seconds": 165.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I have anxiety, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.82,
      "end_seconds": 167.7,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.0,
      "end_seconds": 180.05,
      "duration_seconds": 11.05,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux, yes i have epilepsy i'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.95,
      "end_seconds": 192.66,
      "duration_seconds": 11.71,
      "text": "Right, so epilepsy is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 194.64,
      "end_seconds": 203.41,
      "duration_seconds": 8.77,
      "text": "It's escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day, doctor. It's omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.01,
      "end_seconds": 207.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Okay, is that that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 208.52,
      "end_seconds": 216.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "For six months. He is on lamotrigine, 100 milligrams, twice a day, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.4,
      "end_seconds": 220.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.2,
      "end_seconds": 225.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.36,
      "end_seconds": 233.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "So, do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.08,
      "end_seconds": 238.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.82,
      "end_seconds": 241.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.79,
      "end_seconds": 248.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.0,
      "end_seconds": 263.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.42,
      "end_seconds": 276.17,
      "duration_seconds": 11.75,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 277.18,
      "end_seconds": 287.64,
      "duration_seconds": 10.46,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Respiratory rate 16, saturation 97 percent, height 179 centimetres. Temperature 36.7, pressure 97 over 56, pulse 96, weight 61 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.15,
      "end_seconds": 289.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.8,
      "end_seconds": 295.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.3,
      "end_seconds": 298.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.24,
      "end_seconds": 317.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "your neck veins are swollen, the heart sounds are muffled and your blood pressure is low"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.68,
      "end_seconds": 325.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.19,
      "end_seconds": 349.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, this looks most like possible cardiac tamponade. Another possibility is a heart attack."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.95,
      "end_seconds": 354.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "oh, what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.12,
      "end_seconds": 363.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.21,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible cardiac tamponade do well once it's treated properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 373.52,
      "end_seconds": 378.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Doctor, I did an ECG before they came in, the result's on your screen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.41,
      "end_seconds": 400.09,
      "duration_seconds": 20.68,
      "text": "Thanks, I'll have a look. We should do an urgent echocardiogram for possible tamponade. You need an urgent heart scan and possibly a drain. We'll catch up straight away. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.93,
      "end_seconds": 406.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.26,
      "end_seconds": 412.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. So, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.25,
      "end_seconds": 417.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.58,
      "end_seconds": 422.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Okay, have a good day."
    }
  ]
}